{"id": "tea:bahvrca-upanisad:1-2", "source": "src:bahvrca-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1-2"}, "paraphrase": "The Goddess alone was in the beginning; she created the world-egg; she is known as Kāmakalā and as Śṛṅgārakalā; from her were born Brahmā, Viṣṇu, Rudra, the Maruts, the celestial musicians and all beings of every kind.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "cosmic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["world-fate", "ultimate"], "original": {"text": "devī hy ekāgra evāsīt / saiva jagadaṇḍam asṛjat / kāmakaleti vijñāyate / śṛṅgārakaleti vijñāyate", "script": "IAST", "edition": "Bahvṛca Upaniṣad, raw_etexts vedaH/misc/upaniShat/shAktA", "licence": "public-domain text; short quotation"}, "concepts": ["cpt:srividya-cosmogony", "cpt:kamakala"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A8"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U23-sakta-srividya"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bahvrca-upanisad:1-3", "source": "src:bahvrca-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1-3"}, "paraphrase": "The Goddess alone was in the beginning; she created the egg; from her were born Brahmā, Viṣṇu, Rudra and all; she is the supreme power, the Self.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "divine", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["ultimate", "world-fate"], "concepts": ["cpt:devi-as-brahman"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "sourced", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": [{"phase": "C", "date": "2026-09-29", "method": "text-locate", "queries": ["e-text bahvrca-upanisad 1-3"], "evidence": ["catalog:raw_etexts:108_Upanishads", "text:sources_raw/raw_etexts/vedaH/misc/upaniShat/mixedPF/108_Upanishads.md"], "result": "partially-confirmed", "note": "The content is located: devī hy ekāgra āsīt … brahmā ajījanat, viṣṇur ajījanat, rudro'jījanat. The e-text is one unnumbered prose section, so the section numbers could not be checked.", "by": "sourcing:U04-minor-upanisads"}]}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bahvrca-upanisad:3", "source": "src:bahvrca-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "3"}, "paraphrase": "She is the supreme Śakti; she is the Śāmbhavī vidyā, called the Kādi vidyā, the Hādi vidyā or the Sādi vidyā — this is the secret.", "tags": {"level": "unmarked", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["sound"], "stage": "intermediate"}, "types": ["sound-language", "teacher-transmission"], "concepts": ["cpt:kadi-hadi-matas"], "terms": ["trm:kadi-vidya", "trm:hadi-vidya"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A8"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U23-sakta-srividya"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bahvrca-upanisad:4", "source": "src:bahvrca-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "4"}, "paraphrase": "She alone, pervading the three cities — the three bodies — illumines them outside and within; free of attachment to place, time and other things, Mahātripurasundarī is the inward consciousness.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ultimate", "body-layers"], "concepts": ["cpt:three-bodies", "cpt:tripura-triads"], "terms": ["trm:tripura"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A8"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U23-sakta-srividya"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bahvrca-upanisad:4-9", "source": "src:bahvrca-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "4-9"}, "paraphrase": "She is Mahātripurasundarī, the inner consciousness; the great sayings ('prajñānaṃ brahma', 'ahaṃ brahmāsmi') are her; her vidyās are named — Ṣoḍaśī, Bālā, Mātaṅgī, Bhuvaneśvarī and others.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "intermediate"}, "types": ["ultimate", "sound-language"], "concepts": ["cpt:devi-as-brahman", "cpt:mahavakyas"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "sourced", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": [{"phase": "C", "date": "2026-09-29", "method": "text-locate", "queries": ["e-text bahvrca-upanisad 4-9"], "evidence": ["catalog:raw_etexts:108_Upanishads", "text:sources_raw/raw_etexts/vedaH/misc/upaniShat/mixedPF/108_Upanishads.md"], "result": "partially-confirmed", "note": "The content is located: mahātripurasundarī vai pratyak citiḥ; prajñānaṃ brahma, ahaṃ brahmāsmi …; ṣoḍaśī śrīvidyā, bālā, bagalā, mātaṅgī, bhuvaneśvarī …. The e-text is unnumbered, so the section numbers could not be checked.", "by": "sourcing:U04-minor-upanisads"}]}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bahvrca-upanisad:5", "source": "src:bahvrca-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "5"}, "paraphrase": "She alone is the self; what is other than her is unreal, not-self. She is the awareness of Brahman, free of the digits of being and non-being, the wave of being-consciousness-bliss; you and I and the whole universe and all the gods are Mahātripurasundarī; the one real thing called Lalitā is the non-dual, partless supreme Brahman.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ultimate"], "original": {"text": "saivātmā tato 'nyad asatyam anātmā", "script": "IAST", "edition": "Bahvṛca Upaniṣad, raw_etexts vedaH/misc/upaniShat/shAktA", "licence": "public-domain text; short quotation"}, "concepts": ["cpt:lalita-as-brahman"], "disputes": ["dsp:maya-sakti-or-avidya"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A8"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U23-sakta-srividya"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
